WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Welcome to the Northridge Campus financial orientation briefing. Semester tuition for the 12 to 18 credit band is due on September 15 for Fall terms.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.250
Students who enroll in the three-installment payment plan pay 40 percent on September 15, 30 percent on October 15, and 30 percent on November 15.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Late fee waivers may be requested once per academic year by contacting Student Accounts before the billing grace period ends.
